250
00:14:41,860 --> 00:14:45,520
Hinokagutsuchi, destroy his
magician of black chaos now!

251
00:14:52,380 --> 00:14:57,757
it looks like my newest spirit monster
has destroyed all your monsters and

252
00:14:57,840 --> 00:15:02,377
thanks to the special ability of my deck
master an additional 700 life points

253
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:09,217
are added to my total now i'll play
spiritual energy settle machine it lets

254
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:13,771
me keep a spirit monster on the field
after i discard one card from my hand.

255
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:18,200
You may as well stay down, Yugi.

256
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:19,700
It's all over.

257
00:15:19,820 --> 00:15:23,000
Don't listen to him,
Yugi! Get up! Silence!

258
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:26,390
Yugi!

259
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:28,420
I still believe!

260
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:31,090
Teya!

261
00:15:32,760 --> 00:15:35,231
Well, this should quiet things down a bit.

262
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:40,357
If you could speak, Yugi, I'm sure you'd
admit now that I'm the better duelist.

263
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:47,300
You have no monsters in play, no cards in
your hand, and no friends to cheer you on.

264
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,400
You're all alone now, Yugi.

265
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:51,720
There's no one left to support you.

266
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:53,500
That's not true!

267
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:55,750
Yugi...

268
00:15:55,833 --> 00:15:58,480
As long as I'm here, you can't be alone.

269
00:15:58,780 --> 00:16:01,540
And I'm not the only
one who's here. Come on!

270
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:09,077
All you have to do is look inside
your heart and inside your mind,

271
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:11,917
and you'll see that your
friends are never far.

272
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,353
They're all right here.

273
00:16:13,540 --> 00:16:14,893
But I don't see anyone.

274
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,159
Just look in here.

275
00:16:18,940 --> 00:16:21,400
I've never seen this room before, Yugi.

276
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:23,480
It holds your recent memories.

277
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:29,100
Joey, Taya, and Tristan,
Duke Devlin, and Serenity.

278
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:31,120
I think I understand now.

279
00:16:31,660 --> 00:16:35,937
As long as our friends are in our
thoughts, they'll never be too far away.

280
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:36,850
Well put, pal.

281
00:16:36,933 --> 00:16:39,877
We'll always be right here
in your mind no matter what

282
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:43,137
that's right You may not
remember your ancient past yet,

283
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:45,160
but you still remember us

284
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,080
That's true

285
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:51,317
But I'm afraid I have nothing
left to fight with that's pathetic

286
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:55,140
Are you telling me my future's
in the hands of a quitter?

287
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,197
Kaiba, Mokuba,

288
00:16:57,280 --> 00:17:02,277
you can't let that little punk
Noah win this duel Yugi I know

289
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:06,500
then get back in the game and
face him like a man Remember,

290
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:08,113
you have my cards, too.

291
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:12,180
And with the power of my deck
in your hands, you can't lose.

292
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:14,400
There may still be a chance.

293
00:17:14,580 --> 00:17:16,160
It lies in Kaiba's deck.

294
00:17:16,460 --> 00:17:17,700
Don't mess up.

295
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:20,080
You've only got one shot left.

296
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:25,260
I will save my friends.

297
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:26,940
Just watch me.

298
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:30,120
You insist on humiliating
yourself, don't you?

299
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:33,320
I won't stop until you're defeated, Noah.

300
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:39,337
Now I play Card of Sanctity
So we both have to draw from

301
00:17:39,420 --> 00:17:43,580
our decks Until each of us is
holding six cards in our hand

302
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:51,020
Yugi We're all here Now draw six cards
One from each of us That's right,

303
00:17:51,140 --> 00:17:53,860
pal Take this Don't give up

304
00:17:54,520 --> 00:18:00,077
Here you go This is for you I
hope it helps Now give that brat

305
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:04,800
a spanking The hearts of all our
friends are in these six cards!

306
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:07,180
I feel sorry for you.

307
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:11,117
Thanks to the support of my
friends, I'm about to defeat you,

308
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:13,877
and that is something
you'll never understand.

309
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,920
I play Monster Reborn!

310
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:19,319
It can revive any monster
you sent to the graveyard,

311
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:22,340
including Kaiba's Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

312
00:18:22,860 --> 00:18:24,280
It can't be!

313
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:26,180
Oh, yes, it can!

314
00:18:26,540 --> 00:18:29,397
Remember, Noah, this duel
began as you against Kaiba,

315
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:34,160
And you destroyed his Blue-Eyes White
Dragon, so I was able to bring it back!

316
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:37,120
Now I activate this card!

317
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:38,662
Polymerization!

318
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:41,837
This allows me to fuse
my Blue-Eyes on the field

319
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:44,626
with the two other
Blue-Eyes cards in my hand!

320
00:18:47,860 --> 00:18:51,940
Now, behold the power of my
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

321
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:57,857
The strongest monster in Kaiba's deck!

322
00:18:57,940 --> 00:18:59,740
I'm afraid there's more.

323
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:02,685
Next, I'll activate my
Quick Attack Magic card.

324
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:05,720
This lets my dragon attack right now.

325
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:08,560
Hino Kakosuchi is finished.

326
00:19:12,060 --> 00:19:13,740
It's not over yet.

327
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,340
Noah, you're wrong.

328
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:20,500
Thanks to the next magic card
in my hand, D-Fusion. Whoa.

329
00:19:21,120 --> 00:19:24,440
It separates my beasts back
into three separate dragons,

330
00:19:24,620 --> 00:19:26,637
each with 3,000 attack points.

331
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:28,460
Uh, no! Wait!

332
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:30,377
There must be something I can do!

333
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:34,040
You've been exposed as the
frightened child you truly are.

334
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,180
For Kaiba and Mokuba.

335
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:39,440
And for all my other friends as well.

336
00:19:40,260 --> 00:19:42,640
Blue-Eyes White Dragons! Attack!

337
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:44,580
Wipe him out!

338
00:19:48,820 --> 00:19:51,880
This madness is finally over, Noah!

339
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:04,460
Thank you.
